# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist-ssr
*.local

# The built SPA ships in Git for the single-service deployment; this deeper
# re-inclusion overrides the root .gitignore's generic `dist/` rule for
# frontend/dist only, leaving Python build-artifact ignores untouched.
!dist/

